# About Camp Otyokwah

## Our History

Camp Otyokwah has been serving youth since 1947. Located in Butler, Ohio, we are a ministry of the Churches of God General Conference, with over 75 years of transforming lives through Christian camping. We provide a place where faith meets adventure in the beautiful outdoors of Ohio.

## Our Mission

Our mission is to challenge individuals to know and mature in Christ through life-changing camp and retreat experiences. Everything we do at Camp Otyokwah is designed to help campers, staff, and retreat guests encounter Jesus Christ and grow in their relationship with Him.

## Our Values

- **Christ-Centered**: Jesus is at the center of everything we do
- **Community**: We build lasting friendships centered on faith
- **Creation**: We celebrate God's creation through outdoor activities
- **Character**: We help develop godly character in all who attend

## Accreditation and Safety

Camp Otyokwah is committed to providing a safe, Christ-centered environment for all campers. Our staff are carefully selected, trained, and dedicated to the well-being of every camper. Camp Otyokwah is a member of CCCA (Christian Camps and Conferences Association).

